# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Keluaran tulis: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), baris-baru.
Keluaran tulis: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), baris-baru.
Keluaran tulis: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), baris-baru.
Keluaran tulis: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), baris-baru.
Keluaran tulis: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), baris-baru.
Keluaran tulis: ([''] tccompare: ['']), baris-baru.
